# Bulk this repo carries that no pod job reads. The pod ROOT disk is 20 GB and
# every project's copy lives on it, so pushing these fills it for everyone.
# Anchored '/dir/***' form: matches through symlinks too, so --delete cannot
# reach pod-side outputs (see runpod.sh, rl-arm-39 checkpoint loss 2026-08-27).
/figures/***
/notebooks/***
/results/afm_pipeline/***
/results/route_a/force_ramp/***
/results/route_a/snapback_movie/***
/results/route_a/snapback/***
/data/runs/***
# Third-party trajectory cache the step-0 job downloads ON the pod. Shield it so
# it is neither pushed nor deleted between jobs.
/data/external/***
